sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Gradio UI
    participant C as ChatService
    participant R as Retriever
    participant V as Chroma (notebook)
    participant B as BM25
    participant X as Cross-encoder
    participant L as Groq LLM
    participant S as NotebookStore

    U->>UI: question
    UI->>C: ask(notebook_id, question, method, k)
    C->>S: load chat history (follow-up context)
    C->>R: retrieve(query, method)
    R->>V: top-20 by cosine similarity
    R->>B: top-20 by BM25 (hybrid)
    R->>R: Reciprocal Rank Fusion
    R->>X: score (question, chunk) pairs (rerank)
    R-->>C: top-k chunks + scores + timings
    C->>L: system rules + numbered excerpts [1..k] + question
    L-->>C: answer with [n] citations
    C->>C: keep valid [n], map to source · page/slide
    C->>S: append user + assistant messages (with citations) to history.jsonl
    C-->>UI: answer + Sources list + retrieved chunks panel
